            parts = listOf(
                StoryPart(1, "The Pile Behind the Hall", listOf(
                    "Behind the school assembly hall sat a collection of old scenery: painted boards, fabric backdrops, cardboard buildings, and wooden frames. The drama club wanted to stage a new play but had almost no budget. Their teacher, Ms Eze, said they could investigate what might be reused, but nobody should move or handle the materials until the storage area had been checked.",
                    "Tunde found a label on one frame showing that it had been used in a production many years earlier. The club searched the school archive and discovered photographs of several performances. The scenery had been stored because the school hoped to reuse it, but nobody had made an inventory."
